{"kind":"text","seq":23,"text":"My best coaster this round scored **6.94 excitement**, up from 6.72 last round. Intensity is 10.22, just over the ~10 guideline. It's a 68-piece twister with 6 inversions and no crash, and its similarity score is 0.40, under the 0.5 penalty line.\n\n- **What changed:** I swapped one of last round's camelback hills for two back-to-back corkscrew pairs (6 inversions in total), then lowered the booster speeds to 20/20/19/18.\n- **Without the slower boosters it failed:** the same layout at the original booster speeds hit intensity 15.25 and excitement fell to 1.60.\n- **Other variants:** slowing the boosters further brought intensity to 10.11, but excitement dropped to 6.87. A faster last booster (22) matched 6.94 but pushed intensity up to 10.27."}
